================================================================================
## Add unit tests around the 0.9.0 features
================================================================================

Context:
Line coverage of the code added or changed in 0.9.0 (diff from the 0.8.x
merge-base d3028871 to 0.9.0, src/**/*.py) was 69%: 3,831 of 12,426 changed
executable lines never ran under the test suite. The gaps were concentrated in
the classes extracted during 0.9.0 (settings split, Lakebase registry store
mixins, Digital Twin services) and in OWL import fidelity. Tests only — no
source change. Real bugs found along the way are pinned with
`pytest.mark.xfail(strict=True, reason="BUG: ...")` so fixing them flips the
tests to failures that must be un-marked.

Changes:
1. tests/units/settings/test_v090_graph_engine_{lakebase,neo4j,settings}.py (new, 147 tests)
   Graph-engine settings: Lakebase projects/branches/databases/schemas,
   provisioning, objects/sync/drop, roles; Neo4j connections, secret scopes,
   health, labels; UC catalogs/schemas; admin gating and reference guards.
2. tests/units/settings/test_v090_settings_*.py (new, 8 files, 444 tests)
   SettingsService facade delegation and admin gate, RegistrySettings,
   RegistryDomainSettings, ScheduleSettings (incl. graph cache refresh),
   PermissionSettings, WorkspaceUiSettings (branding, logo, TTLs, limits,
   toggles), WarehouseSettings (Build vs Query warehouses), ObxSettings.
3. tests/units/registry/_v090_fake_pg.py, test_v090_lakebase_*.py (new, 7 files, 165 tests)
   Real Lakebase registry mixin SQL against a recording fake cursor: catalog
   and guarded version deletion, Knowledge Store documents and corpus copy,
   bootstrap, build runs, analytics, review/change events, comments/tasks,
   edit locks, schedules. Asserts bind parameters (no interpolation).
4. tests/units/dtwin/test_v090_dq_sql_{builder,checks}.py (new, 96 tests)
   QualitySqlBuilder SQL and escaping; SqlQualityChecks for SHACL, SWRL,
   decision tables and aggregate rules, violation limits, error results.
5. tests/units/dtwin/test_v090_twin_*.py (new, 5 files, 184 tests)
   TwinStoreCache, TwinGraphBuild, TwinLakehouseBuild,
   TwinInferredMaterialize, TwinGraphStats, TwinBackgroundTasks,
   TwinAnalytics (Build warehouse routing), TwinMapping.
6. tests/units/ontology/test_v090_*.py (new, 6 files, 181 tests)
   OWL import fidelity (labels vs names, language tags, external IRIs,
   rdf_extras), merge resolutions, OntologyGroups, OntologyRules, staged
   Generate merge idempotency, OWL output cleanup, Ontology facade.
7. tests/units/graphdb/test_v090_graph_access_*.py (new, 5 files, 257 tests)
   Search-cache mode resolution and live-graph fallback, GraphFilter preview
   and BFS budgets, GraphFind paging/has_more, SPARQL playground capability
   validator, TwinGraphAccess/TwinResolve/TwinSparqlTranslate.

Bugs pinned by strict xfail (not fixed):
- src/back/objects/ontology/OntologyOwl.py:146-148, 261-262
  clean_owl_output lowercases camelCase/PascalCase local names
  (:OrderLine -> :Orderline, :hasOrderLine -> :hasorderline,
  :first_name -> :firstname). Used by agents/agent_owl_generator/engine.py:345.
- src/back/objects/domain/GraphEngineNeo4jSettings.py:282 and
  GraphEngineSettings.py:440 call _ss.is_neo4j_password_from_secret, which is
  not imported in the SettingsService module (AttributeError).
- src/back/objects/domain/GraphEngineSettings.py:108 calls _ss.DatabricksClient,
  not imported in SettingsService: Lakehouse health always fails.
- src/back/objects/domain/GraphEngineSettings.py:405 duplicate Neo4j connection
  name check is unreachable; duplicates are silently dropped.
- src/back/objects/registry/store/lakebase/LakebaseRegistryAnalytics.py:300
  _GRAPH_ANALYTICS_RUNS_CAP is undefined: graph_analytics_runs is never pruned.
- src/back/objects/digitaltwin/SqlQualityChecks.py:427 SWRL progress offset
  counts decision tables and aggregate rules as already done.
- src/back/objects/digitaltwin/QualitySqlBuilder.py:90-112 an unknown value
  check type emits an unfiltered query (every value becomes a violation); LIKE
  wildcards in check values are not escaped.
- src/back/core/graphdb/entity_search.py:73-84 (also GraphFind and
  GraphDBBackend.find_subjects_by_type) LIKE wildcards in Explorer search
  values are not escaped.
- src/back/objects/digitaltwin/TwinMapping.py:314-316 augmented uri_template
  ends with a stray "}" ("{id}}").
- src/back/core/w3c/owl/OntologyParser.py:638 "Unknown Ontology" default
  defeats the domain-name fallback in OntologyImport.
- src/back/core/w3c/rdfs/RDFSParser.py:440 base_uri falls back to the first
  bound rdflib prefix instead of the vocabulary namespace.
- src/back/core/w3c/shacl/SHACLService.py:111 random shape ids make SHACL
  re-import duplicate shapes instead of replacing them.

